{"title":"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 12A Problems\">2014 AMC 12A #9</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">2014 AMC 10A #10</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(fast)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (fast)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Five positive consecutive integers starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> have average <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. What is the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> consecutive integers that start with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/e/6fec7c4a4dc839bbb78aa5279521fcb32ab4e1bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ a+3\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ a+4\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ a+5\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ a+6\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ a+7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"508\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/2/502e059d1a020b368aee3a99c5669d88331d321f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" />. Our list is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/2/d2289231163b75dca0daf0f842ee0fba6f289fc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{1,2,3,4,5\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" /> with an average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/7570405e2d4fee5e48684d8394452bb11a63e5ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15\\div 5=3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"82\" height=\"13\" />. Our next set starting with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/8/aa89af46bb4fcda830729b491fac232f296c0715.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{3,4,5,6,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"98\" height=\"20\" />. Our average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/4/ad4f9b90cdd4a6ca7ea33fd2a4682e94c7943b58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\div 5=5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, we notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecb6bbecd2c0c1d613e2547cf0023797994fe99.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5=1+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> which means that the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7417af88fc5db87098196fd0c1d5d617f2f84a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ a+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a6864d90f09646e0670de52b58eca0e6c0b1d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b=\\frac{a+a+1+a+2+a+3+a+4}{5}\\]\" width=\"296\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/3/d0319fc0f9cb638d8026e4c6e9d642c5ea7d3727.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies b =a+2\\]\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>We are asked to find the average of the 5 consecutive integers starting from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />. By substitution, this is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/6/5169a0e7b4ba46f5065ee9b32f4356bd2a7b90ef.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a+2+a+3+a+4+a+5+a+6}5=a+4\\]\" width=\"360\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/7/9c7417af88fc5db87098196fd0c1d5d617f2f84a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ a+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"86\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28fast.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(fast)\">Solution 3 (fast)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (fast)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know from experience (or logical reasoning) that the average of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> consecutive numbers is the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/f/81f232863f6c52bf3177e6cc99f1659c9025da91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^\\text{rd}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> one or the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e812ffc8595ea4c89130304a249b52b56bc68449.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^\\text{st} + 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" />. With the logic, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b9223927ab29544d6991e7d02ee15861a98212e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=a+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/c/20c57c946bec971779eba827be6068e9eced9c5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+2=(a+2)+2=\\boxed{a+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"228\" height=\"26\" />.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The list of numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/6/32646af512fe1bb92ba5af59379b5bf598731eb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{a,\\ a+1,\\ b,\\ a+3,\\ a+4\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"215\" height=\"20\" /> so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b9223927ab29544d6991e7d02ee15861a98212e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=a+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />. The new list is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/2/84217532a79fd2cdcfe47067389bcc7a928ad529.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left\\{a+2,\\ a+3,\\ a+4,\\ a+5,\\ a+6\\right\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"279\" height=\"20\" /> and the average is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/7/7579faf7a8ac41f96ff5e2f35d61352997d0f4bf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+4 \\Longrightarrow \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } a+4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"169\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~JH. L\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/GonWHjrROzI\">https://youtu.be/GonWHjrROzI</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/wBdD6Ge8FuE\">https://youtu.be/wBdD6Ge8FuE</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY\">https://youtu.be/rJytKoJzNBY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A\">2014 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">Problem 9</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">16<